    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we have a massive problem. That memo about the community center funding vote just leaked to the press. It's looking bad. If people realize he voted against it, our polling is gonna tank. I need a strategy for the press conference tomorrow. How do we handle questions about his actual vote?",
